<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">Scheduled Follow-ups</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Schedule WhatsApp follow-up messages to leads. The system automatically sends the message at the scheduled time, even when you are away.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">How to Use</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>Schedule:</strong> Click "Schedule Follow-up", select a lead, write your message, and pick a date & time</li>
      <li><strong>Filter:</strong> Use the status tabs (All, Pending, Sent, Failed, Cancelled) to filter your list</li>
      <li><strong>Cancel:</strong> Click "Cancel" on a pending follow-up to prevent it from being sent</li>
      <li><strong>Delete:</strong> Remove a follow-up record — this does not unsend already-delivered messages</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Message Statuses</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-yellow-700 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">Pending</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Waiting to be sent at the scheduled time</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-green-50 border border-green-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-green-700 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">Sent</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Successfully delivered via WhatsApp API</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-red-50 border border-red-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-red-700 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">Failed</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Could not be delivered — check the error message</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-gray-100 border border-gray-200 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-gray-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">Cancelled</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Manually cancelled before the scheduled time</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Rules & Limits</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Follow-ups can only be scheduled for a <strong>future date and time</strong></li>
      <li>Each follow-up must be linked to a valid <strong>lead with a phone number</strong></li>
      <li>If the lead hasn't messaged within 24 hours, Meta may reject the message — consider using templates</li>
      <li>Follow-ups are processed every <strong>1 minute</strong> — slight delay (up to 60 seconds) is normal</li>
      <li>WhatsApp API must be <strong>configured and active</strong> in Settings for delivery</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Scheduled time must be in the future"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">You selected a date/time that has already passed. Choose a future date and time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Lead phone number is missing"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The selected lead does not have a phone number. Update the lead's contact details first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Failed: WhatsApp API error"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Common causes: expired access token, invalid phone number format, or rate limits exceeded.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Failed: Recipient not on WhatsApp"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The phone number is not registered on WhatsApp. Verify the number and country code.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
